Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Wiki|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Wiki|
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
		|portletName|Wiki Display|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki Display|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Wiki Front Page Child Page
Priority: 5
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto CP
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And WikiPage add Front Page CP
		|wikiFrontPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And WikiDisplayPortlet configure Setup PG
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
		|wikiPageName|FrontPage|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG Via WD
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And WikiPage add Child Page PG Via WD
		|wikiChildPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Content|
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	Then WikiPage view Child Page PG Via WD
		|wikiChildPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Content|
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
Scenario: Add Wiki Front Page Child Page Format HTML
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|welcomeToLiferay||
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto CP
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And WikiPage add Front Page CP
		|wikiFrontPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And WikiDisplayPortlet configure Setup PG
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
		|wikiPageName|FrontPage|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG Via WD
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And AssertClick the value 'Add Child Page' at locator 'Link#ADD_CHILD_PAGE'
	And WikiEntry select Page Format
		|pageFormat|HTML|
	And WikiEntry confirm HTML
	And WikiEntry add Page Title
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
	And Click click At at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_EDITOR_SWITCH_ACE_EDITOR'
	And Type type Ace Editor the value '${welcomeToLiferay}' at locator 'TextArea#ACE_EDITOR'
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And WikiPage view Child Page PG Via WD
		|wikiChildPageContent|Welcome to LIFERAY|
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And WikiNavigator goto Child Page PG
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
	Then WikiPage view Child Page PG
		|wikiChildPageContent|Welcome to LIFERAY|
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
