Scenario: Delete Wiki Front Page
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto CP
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And WikiPage add Front Page CP
		|wikiFrontPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And WikiDisplayPortlet configure Setup PG
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
		|wikiPageName|FrontPage|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages PG Via WD
	And WikiPage delete Front Page PG Via WD
		|assetType|Wiki Page|
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Display Test Page|
	Then WikiPage view Default PG Via WD
		|wikiFrontPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
		|wikiPageName|FrontPage|
Scenario: View Configuration Setup Page Front Page
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
